{"claim_id":"CH3_008","source_path":"/sdcard/NEXUS_LLM_WIKI/raw/new/Advice All Creators Need to Hear Right Now (Including Myself).txt","statement":"ينتقد المصدر إنتاج فيديو طويل منخفض القيمة لكل دقيقة، ويدعو إلى احترام وقت الجمهور.","evidence_type":"direct_quote","evidence_start":0,"evidence_end":430,"evidence_quote":"I [&nbsp;__&nbsp;] up. This was supposed to be a completely different video uh than what I'm filming right now. We were gonna make a video on how to make your filming environment better to get better content. And about 2 minutes into sitting down and talking to the camera, I realized that this was not a good video. And the reason why it wasn't a good video is because it didn't respect your time. It didn't have a high value per","excerpt_sha256":"37faae734aa928b44fdd5aa0f467fd1bf1472be37ca9d8c97ef810a98fec3150","scope":"نصيحة تحريرية من المتحدث؛ لا تثبت علاقة سببية بالأداء.","confidence":"source_reported","status":"candidate"}
{"claim_id":"CH3_009","source_path":"/sdcard/NEXUS_LLM_WIKI/raw/new/Brez Scales $370kmo funnel breakdown (genius but weird).txt","statement":"يعرض المصدر حالة funnel لخدمة coaching مرتفعة السعر، من جذب الزيارات إلى العملاء المحتملين ثم الإغلاق.","evidence_type":"reported_result","evidence_start":0,"evidence_end":430,"evidence_quote":"Hello guys. In this video, I'm going to be going over how this 20-year-old kid, Breast Gales, is making more than $300,000 a month with selling his high ticket coaching offer. And I'm going to be going over step by step how he's getting traffic, how he's getting high quality leads from the traffic, and how the process from actually collecting the lead and closing them looks like. So sales process. Yeah. So we are going to be c","excerpt_sha256":"4d40654e1d9691eefab37a6d09b89e9107916eb934ba22c9a43576c051894eae","scope":"حالة/تفكيك funnel منسوبة للمصدر؛ ليست benchmark ولا ضماناً.","confidence":"source_reported","status":"candidate"}
{"claim_id":"CH3_010","source_path":"/sdcard/NEXUS_LLM_WIKI/raw/new/Building landing page funnels with Claude (cancel GHL).txt","statement":"يقول المصدر إن Claude استُخدم لإعادة بناء landing-page funnels مع مقارنة بجودة وتصميم funnel قائم.","evidence_type":"reported_result","evidence_start":0,"evidence_end":430,"evidence_quote":"In this video, I bring you another real use case from an agency using Claude to automate workflows and improve the output. Today we're going to be talking about landing pages. We run a ton of paid traffic from Facebook and we've relied heavily on VSL funnels for the last 10 years. Claude is now building these like that and the quality design is even better. You want to take my word for it, let's actually look at the funnel rig","excerpt_sha256":"a307010e74dc0c70361a08ba5297ffffdb82431d34ff7bbe06e9588fb0e4a860","scope":"تجربة أداة كما يصفها المصدر؛ لا يثبت تفوقاً عاماً أو معدل تحويل.","confidence":"source_reported","status":"candidate"}

